#: ../../source/guide/output.md:1 f46417a8113b457b9456c7f0bfee102d
msgid "产物与轨道库"
msgstr "Artifacts and the Orbit Library"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:3 6db9e231e398479eb072a471a063123f
msgid "catalog/ 目录"
msgstr "The catalog/ Directory"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:5 1ec7edc5e2e74683b4b273931feb36d1
msgid ""
"v4.0.0 起，界面计算产物统一持久化到 **e2m2e 轨道库**（catalog），不再按工具 分目录落 JSON/NPZ "
"文件。轨道库默认位于 sidecar 工作目录下的 `catalog/`： 开发期即仓库根 `catalog/`，安装版在安装目录下；可用环境变量"
" `$E2M2E_CATALOG_DIR` 改指。"
msgstr "Since v4.0.0, UI computation products persist uniformly in the **e2m2e orbit library** (catalog) instead of per-tool JSON/NPZ files. The library defaults to `catalog/` under the sidecar working directory: the repo root in development, the install directory for the packaged app; override with the `$E2M2E_CATALOG_DIR` environment variable."

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:10 919feb7d576b4d24ae18f188a50f440a
msgid ""
"产物**自动入库**：族生成成功后即成为库记录（多维分类：族类型、平动点、 Jacobi "
"区间、振幅区间；谱系指针记录上下游因果链）。重启后项目树经 `catalog_query` 恢复清单，单条记录经 `catalog_get` "
"懒加载轨迹。"
msgstr "Products are **stored automatically**: a generated family becomes a library record on success (multi-dimensional classification: family type, libration point, Jacobi and amplitude ranges; lineage pointers record upstream/downstream causality). After a restart the project tree restores the listing via `catalog_query`, and a single record lazy-loads its trajectories via `catalog_get`."

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:14 e68ee32401fa4364b49f78bd33e64091
msgid "库即数据格式"
msgstr "The Library as Data Format"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:16 bdcea9bfc9bc4e7b9950b77066535648
msgid ""
"轨道库是 e2m2e catalog 格式（见 [e2m2e "
"文档](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/)）："
msgstr "The orbit library is the e2m2e catalog format (see the [e2m2e docs](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/)):"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:19 8e05c832631949908b68b00a7783d833
msgid "记录按多维分类索引，支持组合过滤查询；"
msgstr "Records are indexed by multi-dimensional classification and support combined filtered queries;"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:20 6685523c5eb34cce97fa7aaa2c90f2b9
msgid "谱系指针（上游记录 id）使「设计 → 保持」等链式产物的因果关系重启不断；"
msgstr "Lineage pointers (upstream record ids) keep the causality of chained products like \"design → station keeping\" intact across restarts;"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:21 9b068e12cfa64df6aeb2477f5b648adb
msgid "库目录可整体拷贝、打包导出，亦可被 e2m2e CLI 或其他宿主直接打开。"
msgstr "The library directory can be copied or exported as a whole, and opened directly by the e2m2e CLI or other hosts."

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:23 3d306b49e72740018c8faa1160bb3bea
msgid "output/ 目录（遗留）"
msgstr "The output/ Directory (Legacy)"

#: ../../source/guide/output.md:25 39fac72172004c24b76aa8457d00c85b
msgid ""
"`output/` 仅保留两类内容：转移轨道遗留分区（`output/transfer/`，catalog "
"分类体系之外的过渡期产物）与脚本化工作流的直接输出。v3.2.3 及更早版本按 「工具分目录 + JSON/NPZ "
"双文件」管理的产物不迁移（ADR 0008），需要时重算。"
msgstr "`output/` keeps only two kinds of content: the legacy transfer partition (`output/transfer/`, transitional products outside the catalog taxonomy) and direct output from scripted workflows. Products from v3.2.3 and earlier (managed as \"per-tool directories + JSON/NPZ pairs\") are not migrated (ADR 0008) - recompute them when needed."

